{"id":"mozgi","lemma":"мозги","pos":"noun","rank":1002,"glosses":["brains (food)","brain, head, intelligence"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B3%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B3%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"мозгов","plural":"мозги"},"examples":[{"text":"У него хорошие мозги.","en":"He has a good brain.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Тебе промыли мозги.","en":"You've been brainwashed.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,null]},{"text":"Я думаю, вам промыли мозги.","en":"I think you've been brainwashed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,null]},{"text":"Я надеюсь, у тебя достаточно мозгов увидеть разницу.","en":"I hope you have brains enough to see the difference.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"enough, sufficiently"},null,{"g":"to see"},null]},{"text":"Вот куриные мозги!","en":"What a bird brain!","words":[{"g":"here is"},null,null]}]}